   "type": "para",
   "text": "“I was recommend by another dentist who didn’t accept my insurance anymore. First time experience was amazing, went in for a cleaning with Genevieve and she was amazing. She was very informing and kind with what she was doing. Will continue to keep coming back “",
   "html": "<p>“I was recommend by another dentist who didn’t accept my insurance anymore. First time experience was amazing, went in for a cleaning with Genevieve and she was amazing. She was very informing and kind with what she was doing. Will continue to keep coming back <img draggable=\"false\" role=\"img\" alt=\"🙂\" src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/17.0.2/svg/1f642.svg\"><br> “</p>",
   "section": 15
  },
  {
   "type": "para",
   "text": "“Everyone there is very nice. They were able to see my son within a day of calling. My son had a horrible experience with an extraction as a little boy and he was nervous to have a tooth pulled again. They made him feel at ease. Afterwards he said he didn’t feel a thing. “",
   "html": "<p>“Everyone there is very nice. They were able to see my son within a day of calling. My son had a horrible experience with an extraction as a little boy and he was nervous to have a tooth pulled again. They made him feel at ease. Afterwards he said he didn’t feel a thing.<br> “</p>",
   "section": 15
  },
